OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly
OL,6,Fcloudy this evening, but cloud soon
OL,7,Fclearing to leave long clear spells
OL,8,Fovernight. A cold, frosty night with
OL,9,Fmost places dry, though the odd shower
OL,10,Fmay affect Caithness.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FThere is the chance of the
OL,13,Fodd shower, but otherwise it will be a
OL,14,Fdry day with variable cloud and bright
OL,15,For sunny spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMostly
OL,18,Fdry with sunny spells Friday, the odd
OL,19,Fshower in the north possible. Dry with
OL,20,Fsome long sunny spells Saturday. Dry
OL,21,Fon Sunday. Cold with frosty nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
